; FARO - resident UI tiles (ui-designer). 12 tiles = the GDD 7.2 field budget ("UI 12": frame 8,
; blank, cursor, arrow, coin). Loaded once at boot with the LCD off, never changes; first in
; vram_order (BG $9000, index 0 = BLANK). Used by the window (dialogue, Start panel) and by every
; full screen and the battle screen. APPEND ONLY: code relies on these runs:
;   FRAME_TL..FRAME_BR (8, order TL T TR L R BL B BR; the 9th piece of a box is BLANK).
; Studio frame language (CABALLERITO/GRIFO/dungeon): thick black line + thin dark gray inner line,
; 1 px white outer margin. FARO theme: rounded outer corners (worn boat wood) and a brass rivet
; (light gray ring) at each inner corner. No HUD separator line anywhere (user preference).

; ---------------- blank: box fill, empty cells, gap of a title tab (must stay index 0)
@ BLANK
