; ---------------- "more text" / "list continues" arrow: a FRAME_B with a down triangle sitting on
; the frame line. Replaces one FRAME_B tile of a box's bottom border (dialogue: col 17, blinks
; 16/16 f with FRAME_B; lists: shown while there are entries below).
@ ARROW_DOWN
